# Projections / ML

- Production models are position-specific quantile GBM (P10 / P50 / P90). P50 is the headline. Do not ship a new head without a walk-forward gate.
- Features: `docs/MODEL_FEATURES.md`. Candidates stay out of production until `docs/FEATURE_SCREENING.md` promotion rules pass.
- Inference on hot paths reads `artifacts/weekly_predictions/` or the draft-pool artifact. `predict.load_model()` is in-process and mtime-keyed.
- Season floor/ceiling use schedule-aware Monte Carlo (`season_quantiles.py`, `mc_schedule_v1`). Do not multiply weekly P10/P90 by 17.
- Sentiment (`yt_*`) is readout/UI unless screening promotes it. Do not silently blend narrative into live projections.
- Injury return windows are heuristics (`docs/INJURY_TIMELINE.md`). Label them as estimates.
- Evaluation numbers live in `docs/EVALUATION.md` and `artifacts/`. Do not reprint stale MAE tables in new product copy.
- Config and paths: `src/config.py`. Training presets: `src/ml/training_config.py`.
